<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady/$0.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady/$0.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.25 higher. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA US 1-3    220-260 lbs    57.50-58.25,</p>
<p>	    approx 120 hd under 250 lbs 58.00-58.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Steady. Top 51.00. US   1-3  350-450 lbs    46.00-46.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>US   2-3  500-650 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
</text>
